            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.19.1+1CH.19.2+1CH.19.3+1CH.19.4+1CH.19.5+1CH.19.6+1CH.19.7+1CH.19.8+1CH.19.9+1CH.19.10+1CH.19.11+1CH.19.12+1CH.19.13+1CH.19.14+1CH.19.15+1CH.19.16+1CH.19.17+1CH.19.18+1CH.19.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 19:1-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima y'ebyo omugabe w'Abaamoni yaafa, omutabani Hanuni yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ku yaakihuriire, yaagira ati: Niinyija kukorera gye Hanuni mwene Nahashi, nk'oku ishe yankoreire gye. Atyo Daudi yaayohereza abagaragwa be kumuyaagira ahabw'okufeerwa ishe. Abagaragwa ba Daudi baahika omu nsi y'Abaamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka abategyeki b'Abaamoni baagira Hanuni mukama waabo bati: Noogira ngu Daudi okukwoherereza ab'okukuyaagira n'okuha sho ekitiinisa? Torikumanya ku Daudi ayohereize abagaragwa be kwetegyereza orurembo n'okurutata, ngu arumareho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.20.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 20:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo Hanuni yaakwata abagaragwa ba Daudi, yaabamwa ebireju by'orubaju rumwe, yaahirimburira rwagati ekicweka kya ifo eky'ebijwaro byabo okugarukira aha bibunu, yaaboohereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baabigambiire Daudi, yaayohereza ab'okubabugana, ahabw'okuba bakaba baine enshoni nyingi munonga. Omugabe yaabatumaho ati: Mugume Yeriko okuhitsya obu obureju burikura, mukaija.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
